---
---
<div class="oipo-diagram-container">
  <h3>⚙️ Mô hình thiết kế Workflow OIPO</h3>
  <p class="diagram-intro">Một workflow chuyên nghiệp luôn tuân thủ OIPO để xác định rõ dòng chảy thông tin và điểm kiểm duyệt an toàn.</p>

  <div class="oipo-layout">
    <!-- Objective Layer -->
    <div class="objective-card">
      <div class="card-icon">🎯</div>
      <div class="objective-info">
        <strong>O - Objective (Mục tiêu nghiệp vụ)</strong>
        <p>Ví dụ: Tự động hóa bản tin AI hàng ngày trước 8h00 sáng, cam kết lọc trùng lặp & dịch thuật chính xác.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Flow Pipeline -->
    <div class="pipeline-flow">
      <!-- Input -->
      <div class="flow-block block-input">
        <span class="block-tag">I - Input</span>
        <div class="block-content">
          <h4>Nguồn dữ liệu kích hoạt</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>RSS Feeds tin tức</li>
            <li>Cron Job 6h30</li>
            <li>Dữ liệu thô khách hàng</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-arrow">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </div>

      <!-- Process -->
      <div class="flow-block block-process">
        <span class="block-tag">P - Process</span>
        <div class="block-content">
          <h4>Các bước xử lý logic</h4>
          <ol>
            <li>
              <span class="step-badge">1</span>
              <span>AI phân tích & lọc bài trùng</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="step-badge">2</span>
              <span>Dịch thuật & tóm tắt ý chính</span>
            </li>
            <li class="checkpoint-step">
              <span class="step-badge gate">Gate</span>
              <span>Checkpoint duyệt nội dung</span>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-arrow">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </div>

      <!-- Output -->
      <div class="flow-block block-output">
        <span class="block-tag">O - Output</span>
        <div class="block-content">
          <h4>Sản phẩm nghiệm thu (Artifact)</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Bài đăng Telegram sạch</li>
            <li>Định dạng Markdown</li>
            <li>Ghi nhận vào Google Sheet</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .oipo-diagram-container {
    background: var(--bg-base);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .oipo-diagram-container h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .diagram-intro {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .oipo-layout {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  /* Objective card */
  .objective-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-primary) 5%, var(--bg-inset));
    border: 1px dashed var(--accent-primary);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
  }

  .objective-card .card-icon {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
  }

  .objective-info strong {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    display: block;
  }

  .objective-info p {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 2px 0 0;
  }

  /* Pipeline layout */
  .pipeline-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1.3fr auto 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .flow-block {
    background: var(--bg-inset);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
    position: relative;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs);
  }

  .block-tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: -10px;
    left: 12px;
    background: var(--bg-base);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 2px 8px;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .block-input .block-tag { color: var(--accent-teal); border-color: var(--accent-teal); }
  .block-process .block-tag { color: var(--accent-indigo); border-color: var(--accent-indigo); }
  .block-output .block-tag { color: var(--accent-primary); border-color: var(--accent-primary); }

  .block-content {
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .block-content h4 {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .block-content ul,
  .block-content ol {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: var(--space-sm);
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .block-content li {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .block-content ul li::before {
    content: "•";
    color: var(--border-strong);
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-right: 2px;
  }

  .step-badge {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    background: var(--bg-hover);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .step-badge.gate {
    background: var(--accent-indigo-bg);
    color: var(--accent-indigo);
    border-radius: 4px;
    width: auto;
    padding: 0 4px;
    height: 18px;
  }

  .checkpoint-step {
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle);
    padding-top: var(--space-xs);
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
    color: var(--text-primary) !important;
  }

  .flow-arrow {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .pipeline-flow {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
    .flow-arrow {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      padding: var(--space-xs) 0;
    }
    .flow-block {
      height: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
